d the reuse-safety rule it implies (e.g. reuse only byte-identical spans whose recorded context matches; re-embed when context class changes).\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA short measurement report + the reuse rule it justifies, linked from the span-schema design (sibling under #6028).\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=muse state=filed source=main-chat-2026-11-04-wave2 -->","closed_by":{"login":"developing-today[bot]","id":347365078,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFLRe1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6038/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}